Provenance (research repository revision 7f01f45):
- src/costream/specs.py example stiffness, guard and damping values are adapted
  from ReKep/control/control_profiles.py; the world-residual adapter in
  geometry.py preserves the convention of ReKep/control/action_composer.py.
- src/costream/predictive/ is adapted from
  ReKep/scripts/extract_predictive_trajectory.py.
- src/costream/reactive/tracker.py is adapted from
  ReKep/perception/tactile/estimation.py.

src/costream/reactive/registration.py and the helpers in reactive/maps.py are
adapted from NormalFlow (https://github.com/rpl-cmu/normalflow), version 0.1.0
as vendored in the research repository at revision 7f01f45, distributed under
the MIT License reproduced below.

NumPy and SciPy are separately installed dependencies with their own licenses.
No model code or weights are bundled. SpaTrackerV2 (CC BY-NC 4.0) is not
included; only its output file format is read. gs_sdk is an optional,
separately installed dependency of src/costream/adapters/gelsight.py.

